        "simulation_description": "Higher target apogee. Forked from 00_fuel_mass_convergence_baseline: target_apogee raised from 13716 m (45k ft) to 10000 m higher. Exercises the outer convergence loop across a wider fuel-mass sweep, more iterations, and higher exit velocities. Expected: success with reached_apogee landing near the new target and fuel_mass converging to a larger value than baseline.",
        "expected_output": "success",
        "checks": {
            "files_exist": ["Convergence high apogee.json"],
            "json_path_exists": ["rocket_parameters", "flight_dict"],
